<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTO CLINCH PORTUGUESE LEAGUE TITLE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTO CLINCH PORTUGUESE LEAGUE TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Porto clinched the Portuguese first division title for a record third successive season when they beat Guimaraes 4-0 away on Saturday.</p>
<p>The win left the northern team 11 points clear of second-placed Sporting, who cannot catch Porto with only three matches to go.</p>
